# TeX Live packages required to build the demo and the test documents.
#
# This list is consumed by the zauguin/install-texlive GitHub Action
# (see .github/workflows/build.yml). One package per line; "#" starts a comment.
#
# It was generated with DEPP (https://gitlab.com/islandoftex/texmf/depp) by
# compiling demo.tex and tests/*.tex, then adding the engine/build binaries
# (latex-bin, luatex, latexmk) that DEPP does not detect, plus amsfonts:
# pdflatex embeds the Type1 Computer Modern outlines (e.g. cmssbx10) from
# that package, but DEPP cannot see them (its font detection is luatex-only).
# (The Palatino outlines used by mathpazo already come from `palatino`.)
amsfonts
babel
babel-german
blindtext
cm
csquotes
epstopdf-pkg
etoolbox
graphics
graphics-cfg
graphics-def
hyphen-german
iftex
kvoptions
kvsetkeys
l3backend
l3kernel
l3packages
latex
latex-bin
latex-fonts
latexconfig
latexmk
lipsum
lm
ltxcmds
luatex
mathpazo
mwe
palatino
psnfss
tools
